{"title":"2021 Fall AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_HS_Competition_Academy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by HS Competition Academy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A two-digit positive integer is said to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/4/074deccfc5b76e836104f9b8ade8b944589fa0b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\emph{cuddly}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"49\" height=\"17\" /> if it is equal to the sum of its nonzero tens digit and the square of its units digit. How many two-digit positive integers are cuddly?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/8/ec810d27bbe2b381d2e1613286cf7af3797c13d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }0\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }1\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }2\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }3\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"353\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/e/bde5c1d64731cce17214b848eca2f7a5b67f18ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\underline{xy} = 10x + y.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"111\" height=\"21\" /> By the problem statement, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/9/79916ece27f39c825bfa425031e66cc209c3ee04.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[10x + y = x + y^2 \\implies 9x = y^2 - y \\implies 9x = y(y-1).\\]\" width=\"436\" height=\"20\" /> From this we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/f/6dfc6ada19b6b1c909b64e2cc4aae3164785a962.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y(y-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" /> must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/a/f6a1b9d5cec741422bfb37f91db47fd7514f5377.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> This only happens when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/9/5d9e6a55d9925f4f72839921788f0d5c1853186f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=9.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"46\" height=\"16\" /> Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/d/dfd1815aec837fdfb62d80e2cc0333f05a145769.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=8.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" /> Thus, there is only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/e/75e101201addd96f637069ef5899fa2b44223efc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" /> cuddly number, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/2/ff27eec22401dbe2ae54572e40538af55dd8d3d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$89.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>~NH14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the tens digit is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and the ones digit is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> then the number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/8/8c8b0d985d7137b67edcdd55029a03843223fe5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"14\" /> so we have the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/b/f5b7e0021b5711ab6ec58e5831491d9299d813b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10a + b = a + b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"131\" height=\"18\" />. We can guess and check after narrowing the possible cuddly numbers down to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/2/b72b9fec728e6091c92787b885e51e6a047d6fa8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13,14,24,25,35,36,46,47,57,68,78,89,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"314\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a313bf06349648df7be807bee95b651604ce7a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. (We can narrow it down to these by just thinking about how <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />'s value affects <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />'s value and then check all the possiblities.) Checking all of these we get that there is only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/e/75e101201addd96f637069ef5899fa2b44223efc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" /> 2-digit cuddly number, and it is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/0/e609f93104b193a2355181ca62ff083ea9fd3821.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$89$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />. Yay!!!\n</p><p>~Andlind\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!!!)\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/u19JD85a9d0\">https://youtu.be/u19JD85a9d0</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ycRZHCOKTVk?t=391\">https://youtu.be/ycRZHCOKTVk?t=391</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/knVmshj9SDs\">https://youtu.be/knVmshj9SDs</a> ~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_HS_Competition_Academy\">Video Solution by HS Competition Academy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by HS Competition Academy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/3Ji2_ZYIsPM\">https://youtu.be/3Ji2_ZYIsPM</a>\n</p><p>~Charles 3829\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/6XwPk7h8CU8\">https://youtu.be/6XwPk7h8CU8</a>\n</p><p>~Lucas\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10A\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10A\">2021 Fall AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2021 